 the Company (or any updates to each thereof). (x) the entering into, amendment or termination of employment contracts with Officers of the Company or other contracts with Directors, Officers, Managers, or Members or their respective Affiliates; (x1) the appointment or change of the independent auditors or deposit banks of the Company; (xi) the acquisition or lease by the Company of any real property, or any sale, lease, or sublease of, or simular arrangement affecting, any real property owned or leased by the Company; {xu) the entering into, amendment, modification, renewal (or election not to renew), waiver, or termination by the Company of any financing document; and (xiv) _ the incurrence or assumption of any material liability or obligation, whether contractually or otherwise, by the Company."
